# Fixture: minimal USB 8.6+ tunnel trace (synthetic; replaces the pending
# hardware capture, see docs/PROTOCOL_USB.md "Open questions").
# Format: one bulk transfer per line (hex). Direction is implicit by order:
# OUT lines would start 00 xx 00 01; IN lines xx 00 01 00.
02 00 01 00
04 00 01 00 18 00
00 0c 00 00 43 50 67 49 00 00 00 03
00 0c 00 00 44 43 75 74 00 00 00 00
03 00 01 00 00 02 00 00 00 00 00 00
04 00 01 00 00 00
